== Discover and submit downstream (realized) ==
GUI -> PRINT : Discover / DiscoverCapabilities
PRINT -> TARGET : lpstat / lpoptions through CUPS
TARGET --> PRINT : queues and capabilities
PRINT --> GUI : Printers / Capabilities event
User -> GUI : set destination, copies, collate, duplex, pages
GUI -> PRINT : Submit(document, page_count, PrintOptions)
PRINT -> PRINT : build deterministic SubmissionPlan
loop each planned submission batch
  PRINT -> TARGET : lp with page/copy/N-up/duplex options
  TARGET --> PRINT : accepted job or error
end
PRINT --> GUI : persistent Submitted / Failed event
@enduml
